      "actions": "free",
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "Frequency once per turn\n\nRequirements Helg's most recent action was to cast a non-cantrip necromancy spell\n\n---\nEffect Helg drains away the life force from a creature targeted by the spell, with a result depending on its Fortitude save (DC 36 Fortitude save). This effect is magical and can be counteracted with Dispel Magic (Level 15, DC 36). This ability cannot affect a creature that critically succeeded at the spell's saving throw, if any.\n\n---\nCritical Success No effect.\n\nSuccess Enfeebled 1 for 1 round.\n\nFailure Fatigued.\n\nCritical Failure Fatigued, and rest does not remove the creature's fatigued condition for 1 week.",
